tax error and is preserved unchanged. Its initial complete screening invocation failed during import before numerical cases; archiveepisode8_round23_import_failure.log is empty stdout, actual traceback returned by tool. The corrected combination is new472. Screen driver now catches import errors and records all30 error cases for464. Original driver savedepisode8_screen_before_importfix.py.\n-467/468 move final point column factor into vector log-masses after row scaling and kernel powers. Positive sums use logarithms; zero sums trigger canonical stable column logsumexp. Both all30 pass with exactly same displayed worstnRMSE asbase. Half-fold variant462 can also combine with467.\n-470/471 replace one final dense class annealing step by transforms evaluated on cached last-stage minimizers.470 retains exactdensefinal transforms (worst0.007023);471 also caches final transforms (worst0.007261). Both all30 pass. This is a materially new lateclass approximation, unlike scalar extrapolation alone.\n\nAll sources and failed attempts preserved under/tmp/research_history;round manifests include exact SHA256 and hypothesis;screen logs include all30 publiccases and structured JSON records. Profiles and fresh benchmarks are diagnostics, never evaluator scores. One startprofile ran concurrently withround1 localscreen, recorded as contended and includes argumentNPZ reads in profiletotal; no officialevaluation overlapped own numericalwork. Freshround1 currently running alone; no retention yet.\nEOF\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": null, "status": "in_progress"}}
